      <div type="clause" n="35">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 35</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hwa of fyrde butan leafe gewende þe cyning sylf on sy, plihte his are.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone deserts an army which is under the personal command of the king, it shall be at the risk of losing his property.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
